!results/attack-matrix-*/
results/attack-matrix-dev/
# E7 full runs: summaries and figures are committed, the per-message CSV (~12 MB) is not
!results/e7-*/
results/e7-*/messages.csv
results/e7-*-quick/
# ML-KEM-768 vs ML-KEM-1024 benchmark (plan B.4): summaries are committed, raw runs are not
!results/kem-768-vs-1024-*/
results/kem-768-vs-1024-*/*.json
results/kem-768-vs-1024-*/long.csv
# Phase E file benchmarks (chunk sizes, resume, full session, E5 chunk frames): all committed
!results/files-*/
